name: Cerulean Bell — forced selection
author: corpus
description: >-
  Cerulean Bell forces 1 card to always be selected. Ante 8 finisher: disable with
  Luchador/Chicot or build around the forced card.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: CeruleanBell
    antes: [8]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheIdol
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
